&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for October 22, 2026. Color: Indigo — divination, discernment, inner-work, dreams. Crystal: Amethyst — divination, temperance, protection, spiritual insight. Herb: Basil (Ocimum basilicum) — prosperity, protection, love, success. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad9e05b1f35d.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:07:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>恐怖季节</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad96859d2ef3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;恐怖季节&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small orange pumpkin with a short stem resting on a black granite surface." height="2113" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ad96859d2ef3.jpg" width="2817"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:35:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随当地季节调整巫术仪式</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad95d28d983c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的季节性巫术可以反映你所居住的地方。如果日历已标记秋天，而树木依然翠绿，你或许可以在筹划季节性仪式前，先留意附近的变化。没必要假装天气已经寒冷。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted storybook scene of a witch in muted rose clothing sketching leaves on a charcoal-railed terrace of an enormous pear house, overlooking a green orchard. Floating pear lanterns glow beside her, ivory serif lettering fills the dark sky, and a gold botanical emblem appears at bottom-right. Text: Your seasonal witchcraft can reflect where you live. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad95d28d983c.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:47:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日天空</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad95290cbf81</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今日天空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Blue sky with scattered white clouds." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ad95290cbf81.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:02:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>天气转阴</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad94f41bbb07</link><description>&lt;p&gt;转阴&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Large white clouds over rugged mountains, with trees in the foreground under a blue sky." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ad94f41bbb07.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:48:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>探访古老红</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad9326b053fc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;参观了一棵名为玛土撒拉的古老红杉。真的感觉像是大自然中的一次神圣体验。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Selfie with a redwood. " height="3088" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mbjones/6ad9326b053fc.jpg" width="2323"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mbjones.some.pics"&gt;@mbjones&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:45:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>秋日瀑布美景难忘</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad8dc4f5d947</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这景色真是百看不厌，也再次提醒了我，为什么我似乎每年秋天都会去跑特劳特溪（Trout Brook Run）。

这张照片是我在整理五年前的照片时找到的，拍摄于威洛河瀑布（Willow River Falls）顶部；当时我们在那里露营，并徒步登上了瀑布顶部。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A high-angle view captures a vibrant sunset over a landscape featuring a meandering river and dense forests, with the sun casting a warm glow through a blue and purple sky with wispy clouds." height="1350" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6ad8dc4f5d947.jpg" width="1800"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:37:54 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>